 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"About the pantry run — still on my mind. I keep coming back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"I did the count twice. The count doesn't change. Nobody's worked the meadow edge, west of the creek in days. We'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Saw things with too many joints. Give them room. That's the whole lesson.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"We went over this,\" Marvin says, a little tired. \"I already told you the truth about that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"...Okay. I'll figure it out.\" They won't ask twice. That much is clear."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Still on that foraging help.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Gotta run. Literally. Bye!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Forget I asked. I'll figure it out.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Do you believe in anything? Now, I mean. After everything.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Yeah — That's not naive. That's load-bearing. Hold onto it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"I believe in breakfast. In people showing up. Small, provable things. The big beliefs all broke — the small ones held.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Still on what you believe in.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Finally. I was wondering when you'd see my value.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then Monique grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "They go very still. Not relaxed-still. Held-still."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Nope. No.\" Monique shakes their head too fast. \"I don't know where you're getting this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "🤝 Monique is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Never mind the food I needed — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"There's still the matter of the ambush of David. Nobody's settled it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "Their friendliness thins — still there, just held at arm's length."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Marvin glances around first. \"People are saying things. About you. Is any of it true?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"I see.\" They take a moment to think about your answer."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"There's still the matter of the ambush of David. Nobody's settled it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "You follow the food, the gifts, the sudden friendliness. Nothing you can prove — yet. Dig again; the trail is still warm."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "You say nothing. The silence sits at the fire with everyone else."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "Counted."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"About what happened to my taken kin — I keep dreaming about rows of pods. Humming. Tell me I'm not the only one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"It's my mother, Siobhan. Was taken at the Scattering. The boring half. She made soup from nothing and they called that boring. Some nights I swear I hear them before I sleep -- the pods, rows deep, humming."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "Then morning comes and I can't say whether it was real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? Not that it matters.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"There's still the matter of the ambush of David. Nobody's settled it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"an old trapline — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"a cellar full of jars — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"Yeah. Sorry. It's -- never mind. Forget I said anything.\" They look away, embarrassed at having wanted something."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "You follow the food, the gifts, the sudden friendliness. Nothing you can prove — yet. Dig again; the trail is still warm."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "You say nothing. The silence sits at the fire with everyone else."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about that foraging help — that was 11 days back. Still on your mind? 'Gotta run. Literally. Bye!'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"It's already handled. Thank you for asking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "Counted."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"As I said — we're still on that foraging help.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"Okay I really have to move now or I'll explode — talk soon!\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? At night I cry quietly so no one hears.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"What are you getting at?\" A glance away, then back. They're choosing their words now."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"Still on what they confided.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "Their eyes do the math before their mouth does. You can see the calculation happening."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "*They've deflected you before. The evidence needs to be heavier this time — one more thread before you speak.*"
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"Fine.\" Sharp. \"You want the truth? I wasn't a blacksmith. I was a musician. I thought if you believed that, you'd trust me faster. I'm sorry. Or I'm supposed to be. Happy now?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"...Anyway. What did you want to ask?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "Something crosses their face — quick, then gone. The practiced expression clicks back into place."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "Monique won't meet your eyes. \"I told myself finders keepers. It wasn't finders keepers. I'm sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "Monique looks at you, level. \"I told you the truth. You can keep poking it, but it's told.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"You're really going to make me say it again?\" Monique rubs their face. \"Fine — but it's the same truth as last time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "🤝 Monique is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 31,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"My wound needs a second pair of hands. Will you help me clean it?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Every day it's angrier. I need it cleaned before it turns — I can't work a wound like this. Wrap it tight when you're done.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Saw things with too many joints. Give them room. That's the whole lesson.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Have you heard what they're calling Inspiration? I'm pushing 'Big Big'. Everyone's got a name for it and nobody agrees.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for telling me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Another time. The village needs me here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Alright. Catch you later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"About the pantry run — I still haven't found anyone. Any chance?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Another day like today and we're choosing who eats. I know where the kudzu root grows thick — come with me and we'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"a burned farmhouse — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Have you heard what they're calling Inspiration? Cormac is pushing 'Big Big'. Everyone's got a name for it and nobody agrees.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"You talk to it -- the System. Have you ever asked? About the taken -- about Yuliana?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"It's my sister, Yuliana. Was taken at the Scattering. The boring half, they said — my sister, boring. I think about that every day. Some nights I swear I hear them before I sleep -- the pods, rows deep, humming."
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "Then morning comes and I can't say whether it was real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Who Ate It?. They just... took Ingrid and David. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"I can't. Not today. Ask me when the work's done.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "You show them Wild Ramps — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get back to it. Good talking, though.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"About who you don't trust — Is there someone here you don't trust? Be honest.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "Their eyes flick, just for a second, toward the fire. \"Noted. I'll watch too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "The warmth pulls back a notch. They're weighing something."
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Still on who you don't trust.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Someone should watch your back. Might as well be me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"They took Ingrid and David — Who Ate It?, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "Monique nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Ask me tomorrow. Everything changes by tomorrow.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"I've got things to see to. Don't be a stranger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 62,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about what's been happening — that was 8 days back. Still on your mind? 'You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine.' We still owe that taken person a proper ending, too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Same weather, different day. I keep notes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Like I said — we're still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Another time. The village needs me here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "You show them Groundnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Haftom bound up my cut proper — cleaned it, wrapped it tight. I don't forget that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "Nobody goes hungry on my watch. That's the whole plan. Everything else is details."
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"All right —\" Luis starts to stand, then sinks back down. \"Maybe not today. The fire's got me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"A hungry village makes bad decisions. I've seen it. Keep bellies full, keep heads clear.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Still on wanting to keep everyone fed.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "A pause. When they speak again, it's about something else entirely."
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "🤝 Luis is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Anyway — that's my cross to carry. What's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"That night — I put down Ugly-Eyes at the treeline. I keep hearing it when I try to sleep.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 70,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"We never did finish talking about what's been happening — that was 11 days back. Still on your mind? 'A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"I do the small things right. The big things notice.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"As I said — we're still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "Luis nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "You show them Common Plantain — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"I'd follow you out past the treeline. Don't tell the others — they'd want to come too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"I've got things to see to. Don't be a stranger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"We're eating through stores faster than we replace them. Come forage with me tomorrow — two of us can fill packs.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"The stores won't stretch past tomorrow, and I'm not choosing who eats. Meet me at where the woodland strawberry grows thick and we'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"They took David — Siege, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "Abraham nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"That's... pretty much all of it, honestly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get back to it. Good talking, though.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 81,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  }
 ],
