  "deathBeat": [
   "d17: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Hannah Guerrero is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d17: 🕯️ Hannah Guerrero is dead — the wild. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
   "d17: The village's quarrel was with Hannah — and Hannah is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers.",
   "d18: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Hushpuppy is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d18: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Understudy is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d19: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Hushpuppy is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
  ],
  "recoverHome": [
   "d18: That night, they bring Hannah home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours."
  ],
  "vouch": [],
  "systemVoice": [
   "d17: SYSTEM: \"Perimeter violated! This is unprecedented! ...Is this unprecedented? Checking. Yes. Unprecedented.\"",
   "d17: SYSTEM: \"INTRUDER REPELLED. The pantry’s aroma is now classified as a defensive liability. The audience is chanting the defenders’ names. Fan clubs are forming. This is how it starts.\"",
   "d17: ◈ ARC III — ENGINES. SYSTEM: \"VIEWERSHIP MILESTONE. Organic unit demonstrates compounding capability. Resonance protocols unlocked.\" — Your gifts deepen. Used in sequence, they resonate. The village is no longer just surviving. It is becoming something.",
   "d18: SYSTEM: Codex and inventory overlay online.",
   "d18: ◈ AUDIENCE TRIAL — SYSTEM: \"A trial, broadcast live. The audience loves a trial.\" Haul 1,000 kcal to the pantry within 3 days. Reward: integration, and a lesson.",
   "d18: ◈ RESONANCE HARMONICS — SYSTEM: \"HYPOTHESIS CONFIRMED. Objects with high observer-attention waveforms function as auxiliary capacitors. We call this RESONANCE HARMONICS. We do not know why the waveforms taste like grief. We have stopped asking.\" — Hold a keepsake. Think about them. The System will d",
   "d18: SYSTEM: \"DEMONSTRATION. Give me that — Knife roll. WATCH.\"",
   "d18: ⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 65. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 5.\"",
   "d18: 📺 SYSTEM: \"We have already cleared your morning. You are welcome. We require 300 kcal of tubers and your full attention. The fans love a cooking segment.\""
  ],
